iple commanders in the game, each bringing unique abilities that change the way you play</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautifully realized 3D world –</strong> The world of Earth vs Mars brings expressive units, vibrant environments, and stunning effects to players</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully Voiced Experience - </strong>The game is fully voiced, bringing commanders, units and story moments to life<br></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Earth vs Mars is our first game under the Relic Labs banner. Relic Labs games differ from our traditional, larger-scale strategy titles (which we're continuing to support and develop) in that they are created by smaller teams with shorter development cycles and a goal of experimenting in new strategy spaces, creating fun new worlds, and getting them in the hands of players sooner. Earth vs Mars was made by a small team of passionate Relicans with the goal of paying homage to some of our favorite strategy games, while adding a Relic twist.</i></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269230/extras/700d48b5e9514a946e1760e3d4beee72.avif?t=1770917725\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269230/extras_big/700d48b5e9514a946e1760e3d4beee72.avif?t=1770917725 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "short_description": "Faced with a terrifying Martian invasion, you must lead Earth’s forces in a battle for our planet’s future. Create powerful human-creature super soldiers to fight an alien menace in this turn-based strategy game.  ", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269230/h